# mtplx-65k-stability-check
owner: mtplx-speedwatch · cadence: every 2h · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that keeps your working 65K setup honest — confirming speed and memory behavior stay stable after restarts or config changes?**

## Prompt
Run a 5K-token benchmark against the local MTPLX instance at 65K context; report tok/s, memory_guard events, and whether the result matches the 8-9 tok/s baseline.

## Evidence
> MTPLX at 65K context — stable, fast, no OOM
> Final test completed: 8.55 tok/s for 685 tokens at 65K context. MTPLX is stable.
